;
; measuring block information
;
;---------------------------------------------------
;
;
001,0,Front Left Wheel Status I
001,1,Position
001,2,Wheel,Temperature
001,3,Wheel Pressure,(actual)
001,4,Wheel Pressure,(specified)
;
002,0,Front Left Wheel Status II
002,1,Position
002,2,Remaining,Battery Life (Month)
;
003,0,Front Left Wheel Status III
003,1,Transmitter Status
;
004,0,Front Right Wheel Status I
004,1,Position
004,2,Wheel,Temperature
004,3,Wheel Pressure,(actual)
004,4,Wheel Pressure,(specified)
;
005,0,Front Right Wheel Status II
005,1,Position
005,2,Remaining,Battery Life (Month)
;
006,0,Front Right Wheel Status II
006,1,Transmitter Status
;
007,0,Rear Left Wheel Status I
007,1,Position
007,2,Wheel,Temperature
007,3,Wheel Pressure,(actual)
007,4,Wheel Pressure,(specified)
;
008,0,Rear Left Wheel Status II
008,1,Position
008,2,Remaining,Battery Life (Month)
;
009,0,Rear Left Wheel Status III
009,1,Transmitter Status
;
010,0,Rear Right Wheel Status I
010,1,Position
010,2,Wheel,Temperature
010,3,Wheel Pressure,(actual)
010,4,Wheel Pressure,(specified)
;
011,0,Rear Right Wheel Status II
011,1,Position
011,2,Remaining,Battery Life (Month)
;
012,0,Rear Right Wheel Status III
012,1,Transmitter Status
;
016,0,Wheel Status (from last Received Wheel ID) I
016,1,Wheel Electronics Status
;0.000.000.000 Status 00h UB. niO 0.00bar, ,
; Digit  1-14 = Identification Number
; Digit 15-25 = Status
;               x0h = Storage Mode
;               x1h = Standard Sending Mode
;               x2h = Fast Sending Mode
;               x3h = Temperature Shut-Off
;               x4h (and above) = Faulty
; Digit 26-33 = Battery Status
; Digit 34-40 = Current Pressure
;
017,0,Wheel Status (from last Received Wheel ID) II
017,1,Wheel,Temperature
017,2,Wheel Pressure,(actual)
017,3,Wheel,Acceleration
;
020,1,Voltage Supply
020,2,Vehicle Speed
020,3,Outside Temperature
;
021,0,Average Outside Temperature
021,1,Wheel 1
021,2,Wheel 2
021,3,Wheel 3
021,4,Wheel 4
;
022,0,Current Load
022,1,Current Load
;
025,0,Current Tire Set
025,1,Current,Tire Set
;
;
;---------------------------------------------------
;
; security access information
;
;---------------------------------------------------
;
;
S00,Tire Pressure Monitoring (J502) Security Access
S01,01503 - General Adaptation "Enabling"
;
;
;---------------------------------------------------
;
; adaptation information
;
;---------------------------------------------------
;
;
A005,0,Specified Tire Pressure at Full Load (Front Axle)
A005,5,Specified Tire Pressure at Full Load (Front Axle)
A005,6,The specified tire pressure is beeing entered
A005,7,without a comma. So 2.4 bar is entered as 24.
;
A006,0,Specified Tire Pressure at Partial Load (Front Axle)
A006,5,Specified Tire Pressure at Partial Load (Front Axle)
A006,6,The specified tire pressure is beeing entered
A006,7,without a comma. So 2.4 bar is entered as 24.
;
A007,0,Specified Tire Pressure at Full Load (Rear Axle)
A007,5,Specified Tire Pressure at Full Load (Rear Axle)
A007,6,The specified tire pressure is beeing entered
A007,7,without a comma. So 2.4 bar is entered as 24.
;
A008,0,Specified Tire Pressure at Partial Load (Rear Axle)
A008,5,Specified Tire Pressure at Partial Load (Rear Axle)
A008,6,The specified tire pressure is beeing entered
A008,7,without a comma. So 2.4 bar is entered as 24.
;
